03:39.093 --> 03:40.011
Jom pergi lagi.

03:40.094 --> 03:41.638
Pergi tanpa Yong-jin.

03:41.721 --> 03:44.849
Ya, Yong-jin rampas minah itu.

03:48.102 --> 03:49.187
