23:29.324 --> 23:30.158
Tiada apa-apa.

23:37.082 --> 23:38.041
Hei.

23:38.125 --> 23:41.086
Dia sampai lagi 30 minit.

23:41.670 --> 23:44.005
Kenapa masak sup rumpai laut awal-awal?

23:44.673 --> 23:46.883
